			"crc": "CRC-16/CCITT-FALSE"
		},
		"notes": [
			"The G502 X line uses a different record order from G502 HERO/LIGHTSPEED. The wired, LIGHTSPEED, and PLUS variants share this physical mapping; this file is the wired variant and has no RGB."
